{
  "title": "Read Replica · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "데이터베이스의 복제본으로 읽기 요청을 분산합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Read Replica</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#guide-1\">읽기 부하를 나누는 방법</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#guide-2\">장애 복구와 리전 간 사용</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>40 / 62</span></div><h1>Read Replica</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>읽기 복제본은 <strong>원본 데이터베이스의 데이터를 복제해 조회 요청을 나눠 처리하는 데이터베이스</strong>입니다. 읽기 부하가 커졌을 때 원본을 계속 크게 만드는 대신 조회용 대상을 추가할 수 있습니다.</p><p>애플리케이션이 쓰기와 읽기 요청을 구분해 연결하도록 구성합니다. 일반적인 RDS 읽기 복제는 비동기 복제<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>이므로 방금 쓴 데이터가 복제본에는 아직 반영되지 않았을 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"asynchronous-replication\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"read-scaling\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cross-region-replicas\"></span><h2>읽기 부하를 나누는 방법</h2><p>원본의 데이터가 복제본으로 전달되도록 구성하고, 보고서나 목록 조회처럼 허용 가능한 지연이 있는 읽기를 복제본으로 보냅니다.</p><p>결제 직후 결과를 확인하는 등 즉시 최신 데이터가 필요한 읽기는 원본에 보내는 방식을 고려합니다. 복제 지연과 읽기 부하를 모니터링합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"replica-promotion\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"engine-specific-replicas\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aurora-replicas\"></span><h2>장애 복구와 리전 간 사용</h2><p>지원되는 엔진에서는 다른 리전에 복제본을 두거나 복제본을 독립 DB로 승격할 수 있습니다. 승격은 복제 관계와 애플리케이션 접속 대상을 바꾸는 운영 절차를 포함합니다.</p><p>읽기 확장은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>의 자동 장애 전환과 목적이 다릅니다. Aurora Replica는 공유 저장소를 사용하는 구조이므로 일반적인 RDS 읽기 복제본과 함께 구분해 이해합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>쓰기와 읽기 분리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>원본 DB</strong><span>쓰기 요청 처리</span></li><li><strong>변경 복제</strong><span>복제본으로 전달</span></li><li><strong>읽기 복제본</strong><span>조회 요청 분산</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">비동기 복제에서는 원본과 복제본의 데이터 반영 시점이 다를 수 있습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>주문 처리는 원본 DB에서 하고 판매 통계 보고서는 읽기 복제본에서 조회합니다. 통계 화면은 약간의 지연을 허용해 원본의 부하를 줄입니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>비동기 복제</strong> — 원본의 쓰기 완료와 별도로 변경 내용을 복제본에 전달하는 방식입니다. 전송과 적용에 걸리는 시간만큼 최신 데이터 반영이 늦어질 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/USER_ReadRepl.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Working with DB instance read replicas ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q054\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q054\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q055\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q055\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q057\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q057\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q057</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q057/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An Aurora application must separate read queries from its writer and distribute them across replicas. Which endpoint should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the writer endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway Elastic IP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The reader endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q057\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume ID</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a>의 reader endpoint는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">읽기 복제본</a>으로 연결을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,4\" data-question=\"Q087\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q087\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q087</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to improve both availability and read throughput for an existing RDS DB instance. Which TWO options address these goals?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q087\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스는 장애 조치, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>는 읽기 확장에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q056\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q056\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q056</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS DB instance needs automatic failover, but read scaling is not required. Which deployment should be selected?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB DAX</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q056\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 standby는 고가용성을 위한 선택이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">이전 용어 <b>RDS Multi-AZ</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">다음 용어 <b>Region</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
